          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Carnivores: Ice Age is a first-person shooter video game developed by Action Forms, and later ported to iOS and Android devices by Tatem Games. It is the third game in the Carnivores series. Unlike the previous games, in which the player must hunt dinosaurs, Carnivores: Ice Age allows the player to stalk large Cenozoic mammals such as mammoths and saber-toothed cats.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Carnivores: Ice Age es un videojuego de disparos en primera persona desarrollado por Action Forms y posteriormente adaptado a dispositivos iOS y Android por Tatem Games. Es el tercer juego de la serie Carnivores. A diferencia de los juegos anteriores, en los que el jugador debe cazar dinosaurios, Carnivores: Ice Age permite acechar a grandes mamíferos del Cenozoico, como mamuts y tigres dientes de sable.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
