          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Carnivores: Dinosaur Hunter",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Carnivores: Dinosaur Hunter lets players explore huge non-linear locations as they attempt to track down a variety of dinosaurs that are armed with some ferociously advanced AI. As a result, these are no \"pea-brained\" dinosaurs -- these are dangerous creatures that are able to see, hear and sense the hunter. If you're not careful, it's very easy for the hunter to become the hunted.\n\nWith a series of different dinosaurs across varied, distinct environments (including pine forests, muddy marshes and rolling hills,) how you approach your target is important. Wind direction, scent and the use of a special dinosaur call are all key elements in tracking your prey.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Carnivores: Dinosaur Hunter permite a los jugadores explorar enormes escenarios no lineales mientras intentan rastrear a una variedad de dinosaurios dotados de una IA feroz y muy avanzada. Así que no son dinosaurios \"de cerebro de guisante\": son criaturas peligrosas capaces de ver, oír y percibir al cazador. Si no tienes cuidado, es muy fácil que el cazador se convierta en presa.\n\nCon una serie de dinosaurios distintos en entornos variados y diferenciados (incluidos pinares, pantanos fangosos y colinas onduladas), la forma de acercarte a tu objetivo es importante. La dirección del viento, el olor y el uso de un reclamo especial de dinosaurio son elementos clave para rastrear a tus presas.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2010",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
